[TITLE]
U57: std::stod("1e999") throws std::out_of_range inside the noexcept initQuality, so upstream terminates; the Rust side returns Err(Terminated) and the gate harness aborts the same way.
initqual gate: Cinit seeding (wet/dry nodes), [INITIAL_QUALITY] overrides, [TREATMENT] compile and
a cyclic co-treatment (ERROR 161), buildup POW/EXP/SAT/EXT with AREA and CURB normalizers,
[LOADINGS], sweeping clocks, DRY_DAYS
